[[using-boot-devtools-remote-application]]
==== 원격 애플리케이션

[source,xml]
----
<build>
    <plugins>
        <plugin>
            <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
            <artifactId>spring-boot-maven-plugin</artifactId>
            <configuration>
                <excludeDevtools>false</excludeDevtools>
            </configuration>
        </plugin>
    </plugins>
</build>
----

[source,properties]
----
spring.devtools.remote.secret=mysecret
----

